Package: codiv
Title: Host-Microbe Codiversification Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Daniel", "Sprockett", , "daniel.sprockett@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2620-7555"))
Description: Performs codiversification scans between pairs of host and symbiont
    phylogenetic trees using multiple statistical methods (Hommola, PACo, ParaFit).
    For each internal node of the symbiont tree, calculates correlation coefficients
    and computes p-values via permutation testing to assess whether symbiont topology
    matches host topology. High correlation at a node indicates codiversification
    between hosts and those symbionts. Includes functions for leave-one-host-out
    analysis, parameter sensitivity assessment, and tree visualization.
    See Sprockett et al. (2025) <doi:10.1038/s41467-025-57435-z>.
